  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 714.12 Recordkeeping Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 714.12 Recordkeeping Requirements. The O/O of a water system that is subject to this part shall:\n\n(a) Comply with the recordkeeping requirements of 40 CFR §141.91, 7-1-16 edition, as reprinted in Appendix B; and\n\n(b) Maintain monthly optimized water quality parameter logs for the life of the corrosion control treatment and make such logs available to the department for review.\n\nSource. #9859, eff 2-8-11; ss by #12181, eff 5-23-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw700.html"
